  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* So like...'
  - '* How was the forest\n  down there safer than\n  whatever''s over here?'
  - '* It looks like the\n  bridge over there is\n  broken.'
  - '* A-^05and a TON of\n  spikes,^05 too!'
  - '* Bet it was the bridge.'
  sounds:
